{
    "title": "myWIC Mosaic",
    "description": "As a WIC client, you will be guided through your clinic and shopping experience in one simple and easy to use app. Take the guess work out of renewing your WIC benefits, manage your family appointments, and be confident you have the right WIC approved foods in your shopping cart before heading to the check-out line.\r\n\r\nWith the myWIC app you experience all these and more:\r\n\r\n- Manage your appointments - Schedule, change and view your appointments\r\n\r\n- Current and future benefits - View your monthly benefits and track your purchases\r\n\r\n- Tailored shopping experience - Use our shopping guide and scanner to get the most out of your benefits\r\n\r\n- Guided certification - Use our step by step process for uploading documents before your WIC appointment\r\n\r\n- Push notifications - Stay informed with reminders and updates about your families\u2019 appointments and benefits sent right to you\r\n\r\nmyWIC currently supports the following WIC programs:\r\n    Texas\r\n    Louisiana\r\n    New Mexico\r\n    Cherokee Nation\r\n    Pueblo of Isleta\r\n    Zuni Indian Reservation\r\n    Santo Domingo (Kewa) Pueblo\r\n    Acoma-Canoncito-Laguna \r\n    San Felipe Pueblo\r\n    Eight Northern Pueblos\r\n\r\nComing soon!\r\n    Five Sandoval Indian Pueblos\r\n    \r\n\r\nHere's what WIC participants are saying about the myWIC app:\r\n- \"It\u2019s great especially when you have a busy day or kiddos having an off day and they wouldn\u2019t last through an in person appointment\"\r\n- \"The app is great it helps me be prepared by being able to upload required documents on time\"\r\n- \"It\u2019s great, thanks for being more efficient. Especially like working moms on the go like me\"\r\n- \"Everything was easy to complete I really hope you guys keep having this way\"\r\n- \"Displaying your available balance on the portal is very handy for us so we don\u2019t have to get a printout at the store before shopping\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "As a WIC client, you will be guided through your clinic and shopping experience in one simple and easy to use app. Take the guess work out of renewing your WIC benefits, manage your family appointments, and be confident you have the right WIC approved foods in your shopping cart before heading to the check-out line.<br><br>With the myWIC app you experience all these and more:<br><br>- Manage your appointments - Schedule, change and view your appointments<br><br>- Current and future benefits - View your monthly benefits and track your purchases<br><br>- Tailored shopping experience - Use our shopping guide and scanner to get the most out of your benefits<br><br>- Guided certification - Use our step by step process for uploading documents before your WIC appointment<br><br>- Push notifications - Stay informed with reminders and updates about your families\u2019 appointments and benefits sent right to you<br><br>myWIC currently supports the following WIC programs:<br>    Texas<br>    Louisiana<br>    New Mexico<br>    Cherokee Nation<br>    Pueblo of Isleta<br>    Zuni Indian Reservation<br>    Santo Domingo (Kewa) Pueblo<br>    Acoma-Canoncito-Laguna <br>    San Felipe Pueblo<br>    Eight Northern Pueblos<br><br>Coming soon!<br>    Five Sandoval Indian Pueblos<br>    <br><br>Here&#39;s what WIC participants are saying about the myWIC app:<br>- &quot;It\u2019s great especially when you have a busy day or kiddos having an off day and they wouldn\u2019t last through an in person appointment&quot;<br>- &quot;The app is great it helps me be prepared by being able to upload required documents on time&quot;<br>- &quot;It\u2019s great, thanks for being more efficient. Especially like working moms on the go like me&quot;<br>- &quot;Everything was easy to complete I really hope you guys keep having this way&quot;<br>- &quot;Displaying your available balance on the portal is very handy for us so we don\u2019t have to get a printout at the store before shopping&quot;",
